  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Frostleaf? Frostleaf?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's going on..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Amiya! This is the 2nd Recon Squad...."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're currently retreating! But, the enemy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Reunion..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It cut out again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "3rd Recon Squad! Do you copy? 3rd Recon Squad!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit! It's me! Did you get--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've been continuously monitoring them from the bridge."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I need you to ask something to that officer next to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ask her..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'How long does Lungmen intend to keep playing dumb?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll pretend I didn't hear that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, we certainly don't have time to waste."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What happened? I just went to grab some forms, and you two look all serious now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...A new mission?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everyone... Gear up. It's about time for us to head out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Madam Ch'en, I'm am formally requesting that the L.G.D. provide assistance to Rhodes Island on this rescue mission."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We may even be dealing with Reunion's new temporary headquarters..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Furthermore, I believe that our recon squads are still out there fighting, even if we can't see them..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
